{
  "name": "rcgen",
  "description": "A robust Rust utility for the generation of X.509 certificates, CSRs, and CRLs, implementing ASN.1 DER serialization using the yasna and ring crates. It supports a comprehensive suite of signature schemes including RSA PKCS#1v1.5/PSS, ECDSA over P-256/P-384, and Ed25519. The library is optimized for creating certificate chains and PKI artifacts for TLS testing and infrastructure, with deep integration for the rustls ecosystem.",
